<!-- â€”â€”â€” Fortissimo: The Cascade â€”â€”â€” -->
<section data-act="2" class="container">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <h2>How Shocks Propagate</h2>
    <p class="t3">The Iran/Hormuz thesis as a directed acyclic graph. Three independent transmission chains converge on EM sovereign stress.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="callout reveal">
    <span class="type">Bottleneck</span>
    Every macro trader thinks in transmission chains. Nobody has a tool that actually maps them, tracks where you are in the cascade, enforces the logic, and tells you what to do with your portfolio at each node.
  </div>

  <div class="cascade-wrap reveal">
    <svg class="cascade-svg" viewBox="0 0 960 340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="cascade-title cascade-desc">
