- Happy path: Alert message includes specific node state changes and countdown info
- Edge case: Both users offline â†’ one generic alert, not two personalized ones
- Edge case: Snapshot arrives within 5 minutes of last curator alert â†’ no duplicate alert
- Edge case: Snapshot arrives but no users in room (room is empty) â†’ no alert, no error
- Error path: LLM call fails during curator generation â†’ log warning, fail silently (non-critical)

